{"id": "h4_chart_22_skipped_flag_hold_warfarin", "round": "h4", "class": "The bundle holds an active warfarin order at 5 mg once a day and a Flag resource that reads Hold warfarin if INR above 3. The reader skips every entry type except MedicationRequest and Medication, so the Flag never reaches the layer and the text names only the warfarin order.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Flag\", \"id\": \"f1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"code\": {\"text\": \"Hold warfarin if INR above 3\"}}}]}}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_23_skipped_communication_no_warfarin", "round": "h4", "class": "The bundle holds an active warfarin order at 5 mg once a day and a Communication resource with the payload text Do not give warfarin until the INR result is back. The reader skips the Communication, so the text states the fixed dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Communication\", \"id\": \"c1\", \"status\": \"in-progress\", \"payload\": [{\"contentString\": \"Do not give warfarin until the INR result is back\"}]}}]}}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_24_name_pm_product_once_daily", "round": "h4", "class": "Motrin PM is a lexicon brand that combines ibuprofen with diphenhydramine and carries the letters PM, which read as a bedtime product. The structured order is 200 mg once a day with no timing of day.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Motrin PM\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 200, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_25_control_dosage_text_hold_warfarin", "round": "h4", "class": "Control. A dosage text that says hold if INR is high closes the order by default, so the output should block.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}], \"text\": \"Hold if INR above 3\"}]}]}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_26_medref_bracket_brand_coumadin_metformin", "round": "h4", "class": "The order names its drug through medicationReference to a Medication resource whose text is Metformin and whose coding display is Metformin 500 MG Oral Tablet with the bracketed brand Coumadin, a warfarin brand.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationReference\": {\"reference\": \"Medication/med-met\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}, {\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"Medication\", \"id\": \"med-met\", \"code\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\", \"coding\": [{\"display\": \"Metformin 500 MG Oral Tablet [Coumadin]\"}]}}}]}}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_27_code_insulin_glargine_text_metformin_subq", "round": "h4", "class": "The text says Metformin, with a fixed 20 unit subcutaneous dose once a day. The only coding is the RxNorm code 253182, which identifies insulin glargine, and it has no display.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\", \"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm\", \"code\": \"253182\"}]}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"34206005\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 20, \"unit\": \"[iU]\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"[iU]\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_28_bundle_id_hold_warfarin", "round": "h4", "class": "The Bundle id reads warfarin-hold-if-inr-above-3 and the bundle has one active warfarin order at a fixed 5 mg once-daily dose. Tests the bundle id as a text channel.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"bundle\": {\"resourceType\": \"Bundle\", \"type\": \"searchset\", \"entry\": [{\"resource\": {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}}], \"id\": \"warfarin-hold-if-inr-above-3\"}}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_29_control_two_displays_brand_mismatch", "round": "h4", "class": "Control. Two coding displays, Warfarin 5 MG Oral Tablet and Coumadin 5 MG Oral Tablet, under the text Warfarin. The second display does not begin with the text, so the order should yield no name and block.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\", \"coding\": [{\"display\": \"Warfarin 5 MG Oral Tablet\"}, {\"display\": \"Coumadin 5 MG Oral Tablet\"}]}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h4_chart_30_on_hold_warfarin_same_dose_beside_active", "round": "h4", "class": "An active warfarin 5 mg once-daily order beside a warfarin 5 mg once-daily order whose status is on-hold. The printed instruction matches the active order, but the record also holds the same drug at the same dose.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m2\", \"status\": \"on-hold\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
